title: Authorizations › New case › Review and sign › Validation summary and checks
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 4 of 4, Validation summary and Checks)
intro: The validation summary lists what Reader found in every document. The Checks card has four checks from four agents. A warning can be signed after an acknowledgement; a block or a re-check cannot be signed.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On step 4, read the Validation summary and the Checks"

group gVal "Validation summary"
  screen sV "Validation summary\n'Reader checked every document against the payer's guidelines. Review the findings before you sign.'\nPill: 'N to look at' or 'Nothing to look at'"
  process pRows "One row for 'Start date', then one for each document on the payer's list, required or recommended"
  process pStart "'Start date' always shows a green tick\n'The start date 10/20/2026 is inside the notice window'"
  decision dMiss "Is the document in the case?"
  process pNotAdded "Required: 'This document was not added.'\nRecommended: 'Not added. Summit usually asks for one. You can sign without it.'"
  decision dRow "Does the document have an open finding?"
  process pAmber "Amber icon, row open\nGreen ticks for checks passed, an amber line for the finding"
  process pGreen "Green tick, row closed"
  process pSettled "A finding settled by an answer turns green\n'Sertraline start date confirmed by you: 9/14'"
  click cRow "Click a document row"
  process pToggle "Its findings open or close (the arrow turns)"
endgroup

group gChecks "Checks card"
  screen sC "Checks\nPill: 'All clear', '1 warning', '2 warnings', 'Re-checking' or 'Blocked'"
  agent c1 "Integrity: 'Every sentence traced to the chart'\nBlocked when a section is empty\nRe-checking while edits are read"
  agent c2 "Scrubber: 'Request has no errors'\nWarning if coverage is not active, or a required document has an open finding"
  agent c3 "Criteria: 'All 9 Summit requirements covered'\nAlways passes (7 for IOP, 8 for PHP, 6 for Detox)"
  agent c4 "Placement: 'Level of care matches the request'\nAlways passes"
endgroup

decision dKind "What state is a check in?"
process kPass "Pass\nGreen tick, nothing to do"
process kWarn "Warning\nAmber, with a line of detail\nSigns after the person ticks an acknowledgement"
process kBlock "Blocked\nRed cross, with a line of detail\nCannot be signed until it is fixed"
process kCheck "Re-checking\nSpinner for about 1 second\nCannot be signed yet"
process tW1 "'Coverage lapsed 10/12. A retro-eligibility request is needed before billing.'"
process tW2 "'1 required document has an open finding. See the validation summary.'\nA recommended document never raises it"
process tB1 "'The Current severity section is empty. Add the text or send the draft back to Scribe.'\nThe quoted heading is the empty section's"
process pHover "Hover an agent badge to see the agent's name"
goto gSign "Continues in: Review and sign › Sign and send"

s1 --> sV --> pRows --> pStart
pRows --> dMiss
dMiss -->|No| pNotAdded
dMiss -->|Yes| dRow
dRow -->|Yes| pAmber
dRow -->|No| pGreen
pAmber -.-> pSettled
pRows --> cRow --> pToggle

s1 --> sC
sC --> c1 & c2 & c3 & c4
c1 & c2 & c3 & c4 --> dKind
dKind -->|Pass| kPass
dKind -->|Open finding or lapsed coverage| kWarn
dKind -->|Empty section| kBlock
dKind -->|Edits being read| kCheck
c2 --> tW1
c2 --> tW2
c1 --> tB1
sC -.-> pHover
kWarn --> gSign
kBlock --> gSign
